---
description: Harden pnpm-workspace with install verification
globs: pnpm-workspace.yaml,.npmrc
alwaysApply: false
---

# pnpm workspace harden

When user asks to harden `pnpm-workspace.yaml`:

1. Read workspace package list — prefer explicit packages over wildcards when securing.
2. Enable supply-chain settings appropriate to pnpm 11 (trustPolicy, minimumReleaseAge, strictDepBuilds) — verify names in docs.
3. Run `pnpm install` after edits; failures block "done."
4. Note trade-offs (mirrors missing `time` metadata, pmOnFail vs corepack).

Registry auth stays in `.npmrc`, not workspace yaml.
